site/raw/

# Superseded prototype art from the pre-Tripo site: flat-shaded boxes on flat
# sand, captured before any generated geometry existed. hero.jpg was the og:image
# on every share of this game until 2026-07-29. Nothing references them now and
# scripts/vite-site-truth.mjs fails the build if anything ever does again, but
# they stay out of the deploy so they cannot be found at a guessable URL. The
# files remain on disk under public/site/ — this only stops them being served.
site/hero.jpg
site/cockpit.jpg
site/map-drill.jpg
site/map-dunes.jpg
site/map-flats.jpg

# models/ used to be listed here: the raw Tripo3D GLBs were ~44 MB each, over
# Cloudflare's 25 MiB per-file asset limit, so the whole directory was skipped and
# the deployed game had no generated geometry at all.
#
# public/models/ now holds only the LOD tiers built by scripts/build_lods.mjs
# (96 files, all under 2 MB, ~68 MB total), which upload fine. Do not re-add the
# exclusion, and never put raw sources in public/ — they belong in
# assets/tripo/generated/, which is outside the served tree.
